---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_results: investor invokes withdrawExcessInvestedCapital(proof, acceptedAmount)
    q_check_results --> q_revert_results: results not published
    q_revert_results --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_results --> q_verify_proof: results published
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: Merkle proof invalid against acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidProof
    q_verify_proof --> q_check_claimed: proof valid
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: excess already claimed
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_check_claimed --> q_calc: excess not yet claimed
    q_calc --> q_check_excess: excessAmount = position.totalInvested - acceptedAmount
    q_check_excess --> q_revert_zero: excessAmount <= 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital
    q_check_excess --> q_transfer: excessAmount > 0
    q_transfer --> [*]: position.excessClaimed = true; transfer(investor, excessAmount); emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn()

    note right of q_verify_proof
        INV-001: Merkle proof validates accepted capital amount per investor
        INV-002: Excess = totalInvested - acceptedAmount
        INV-003: Each investor can claim excess exactly once
    end note
